  "title": "Transocean Ltd. Announces Agreement with Equinor Valued at Over $1 Billion",
  "summary": "STEINHAUSEN, Switzerland, June 30, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- Transocean Ltd. (NYSE: RIG) (“Transocean”) today announced its entry into an agreement with Equinor, conditional to license approvals, for the use of three of its harsh environment semisubmersible rigs on the Norwegian shelf.",
